{"id":1141003,"name":"Helga - Interrogation III","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"Helga - Interrogation III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1141003]}],"trial":{"trial_id":141003,"stage":"Phase 3","unlock_time":"2026-02-14 05:00:00","diary1":"One week ago, Helga, the current Speaker of the Farlands, came to the Bureau alone and sat herself down in the interrogation room, all to prove her convictions and earn your support.\nNow, one week later, only the two of you remain. But together, you will see this mission through.","diary2":"Through the combined efforts of everyone, the Alsa Highlands are successfully purified. The dark mist lifts at last, and light shines once more upon the scorched earth, illuminating those who have passed, and those who remain. This may only be a beginning, but for the farlands, it is precious enough.\nThroughout it all, Helga guards your back, pointing her barrel forward, every shot scattering the shadows that lunge for those young souls.\nThis will never be just the farlands' fight. It is everyone's battle. You do not yet know where this road will ultimately lead, but the path will certainly be a bright one.","evidence":[{"ID":260863,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260864,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":241003001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":7,"dialogue_id":241003002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":1,"dialogue_id":241003003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241003011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue